# Notebook output never reaches the index: git pipes every .ipynb through
# nbstripout's clean filter BEFORE it compares, so a re-run that only changed
# cell results shows up as no diff at all. The working copy is untouched -- the
# notebook you have open keeps the figures you just rendered.
#
# The filter definition is per-clone local config, so enable it once per clone:
#     pixi global install nbstripout
#     nbstripout --install --attributes .gitattributes
#
# `.githooks/pre-commit` strips the same things at commit time and stays as the
# fallback for a clone where the above was never run (enable that one with
# `git config core.hooksPath .githooks`).
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout
*.zpln filter=nbstripout
*.ipynb diff=ipynb
